{"id":"a840395646191699","group":"58","path":"58/batch02/58-df-siegel-walfisz.md","title":"Siegel–Walfisz Theorem","display":"df-siegel-walfisz — Siegel–Walfisz Theorem","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-siegel-walfisz","aliases":["58-df-siegel-walfisz"],"display":"df-siegel-walfisz — Siegel–Walfisz Theorem","depends_on":["[[../batch18/58-df-arithmetic-progression.md]]","[[../batch20/58-df-integer.md]]","[[../batch20/58-df-prime.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-siegel-walfisz"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-siegel-walfisz</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-siegel-walfisz — Siegel–Walfisz Theorem"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"6c68e3aece7c6ffc\" href=\"?note=6c68e3aece7c6ffc\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-arithmetic-progression.md\">../batch18/58-df-arithmetic-progression.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"244943f88396309f\" href=\"?note=244943f88396309f\" title=\"../batch20/58-df-integer.md\">../batch20/58-df-integer.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"3322615e4eea05e9\" href=\"?note=3322615e4eea05e9\" title=\"../batch20/58-df-prime.md\">../batch20/58-df-prime.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\">\\(A\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\mathbb R\">\\(x\\in\\mathbb R\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\geq3\">\\(x\\geq3\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\">\\(q\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\\in\\mathbb Z\">\\(a\\in\\mathbb Z\\)</span>，并在断言中要求 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\gcd(a,q)=1\">\\(\\gcd(a,q)=1\\)</span>（see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"6c68e3aece7c6ffc\" href=\"?note=6c68e3aece7c6ffc\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-arithmetic-progression.md\">../batch18/58-df-arithmetic-progression.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Prime}_{\\mathbb N}\">\\(\\operatorname{Prime}_{\\mathbb N}\\)</span>（自然数素数谓词，see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"3322615e4eea05e9\" href=\"?note=3322615e4eea05e9\" title=\"../batch20/58-df-prime.md\">../batch20/58-df-prime.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Lambda(n)\">\\(\\Lambda(n)\\)</span> 为 von Mangoldt 函数，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi(q)\">\\(\\varphi(q)\\)</span> 为 Euler 函数（本文件显式定义）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\psi(x;q,a)\\coloneqq\\sum_{\\substack{n\\leq x\\\\n\\equiv a\\pmod q}}\\Lambda(n)\">\\(\\psi(x;q,a)\\coloneqq\\sum_{\\substack{n\\leq x\\\\n\\equiv a\\pmod q}}\\Lambda(n)\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SiegelWalfisz}_S(A)\">\\(\\mathrm{SiegelWalfisz}_S(A)\\)</span>（本文件定义的 Siegel–Walfisz 估计谓词）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}siegel\\text{-}walfisz\\text{-}mangoldt}\\vdash\n\\Lambda(n)\\coloneqq\n\\sum_{\\substack{p\\in\\mathbb N,\\ m\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\\\\n\\operatorname{Prime}_{\\mathbb N}(p),\\ p^m=n}}\n\\log p.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}siegel\\text{-}walfisz\\text{-}mangoldt}\\vdash\n\\Lambda(n)\\coloneqq\n\\sum_{\\substack{p\\in\\mathbb N,\\ m\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\\\\n\\operatorname{Prime}_{\\mathbb N}(p),\\ p^m=n}}\n\\log p.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}siegel\\text{-}walfisz\\text{-}totient} \\vdash\n\\varphi(q)\\coloneqq|\\{r\\in q\\mid\\gcd(r,q)=1\\}|\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}siegel\\text{-}walfisz\\text{-}totient} \\vdash\n\\varphi(q)\\coloneqq|\\{r\\in q\\mid\\gcd(r,q)=1\\}|\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}siegel\\text{-}walfisz\\text{-}chebyshev} \\vdash \\psi(x;q,a)\\coloneqq\\sum_{\\substack{n\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\\\n\\leq x\\\\n\\equiv a\\pmod q}}\\Lambda(n)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}siegel\\text{-}walfisz\\text{-}chebyshev} \\vdash \\psi(x;q,a)\\coloneqq\\sum_{\\substack{n\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\\\n\\leq x\\\\n\\equiv a\\pmod q}}\\Lambda(n)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}siegel\\text{-}walfisz} \\vdash \\mathrm{SiegelWalfisz}_S(A)\\leftrightarrow\\left(A\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\land\\exists C_A,c_A,x_A\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\forall x\\in\\mathbb R\\;\\left(\\max\\{3,x_A\\}\\leq x\\to\\forall q\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\;\\left(q\\leq(\\log x)^A\\to\\forall a\\in\\mathbb Z\\;\\left(\\gcd(a,q)=1\\to\\left|\\psi(x;q,a)-\\frac{x}{\\varphi(q)}\\right|\\leq C_Axe^{-c_A\\sqrt{\\log x}}\\right)\\right)\\right)\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}siegel\\text{-}walfisz} \\vdash \\mathrm{SiegelWalfisz}_S(A)\\leftrightarrow\\left(A\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\land\\exists C_A,c_A,x_A\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\forall x\\in\\mathbb R\\;\\left(\\max\\{3,x_A\\}\\leq x\\to\\forall q\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\;\\left(q\\leq(\\log x)^A\\to\\forall a\\in\\mathbb Z\\;\\left(\\gcd(a,q)=1\\to\\left|\\psi(x;q,a)-\\frac{x}{\\varphi(q)}\\right|\\leq C_Axe^{-c_A\\sqrt{\\log x}}\\right)\\right)\\right)\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Siegel–Walfisz gives error term for primes in arithmetic progression.</li>\n<li>无条件证明中的常数通常是无效的，根源是 Siegel 零点问题；这不是“尚未证明 GRH”这一句话本身。</li>\n<li>断言显式量化 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span>、模数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q\">\\(q\\)</span>、剩余类 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\">\\(a\\)</span> 以及依赖于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 的常数，避免把含自由变量的渐近式误作闭命题。</li>\n<li>Mangoldt 函数用集合有界求和定义；素数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\">\\(p\\)</span> 不再出现在其存在量词作用域之外。</li>\n<li>Improved in average form by the Bombieri-Vinogradov theorem.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch18/58-df-arithmetic-progression.md","status":"resolved","id":"6c68e3aece7c6ffc","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-arithmetic-progression.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch20/58-df-integer.md","status":"resolved","id":"244943f88396309f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch20/58-df-integer.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch20/58-df-prime.md","status":"resolved","id":"3322615e4eea05e9","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch20/58-df-prime.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-arithmetic-progression.md","status":"resolved","id":"6c68e3aece7c6ffc","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$q\\in\\mathbb N_{>0}$ 与 $a\\in\\mathbb Z$，并在断言中要求 $\\gcd(a,q)=1$（see [[../batch18/58-df-arithmetic-progression.md]]）","embed":false},{"target":"../batch20/58-df-prime.md","status":"resolved","id":"3322615e4eea05e9","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Prime}_{\\mathbb N}$（自然数素数谓词，see [[../batch20/58-df-prime.md]]）","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A\\in\\mathbb R_{>0}","display":false},{"tex":"x\\in\\mathbb R","display":false},{"tex":"x\\geq3","display":false},{"tex":"q\\in\\mathbb N_{>0}","display":false},{"tex":"a\\in\\mathbb Z","display":false},{"tex":"\\gcd(a,q)=1","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Prime}_{\\mathbb N}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Lambda(n)","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi(q)","display":false},{"tex":"\\psi(x;q,a)\\coloneqq\\sum_{\\substack{n\\leq x\\\\n\\equiv a\\pmod q}}\\Lambda(n)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SiegelWalfisz}_S(A)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}siegel\\text{-}walfisz\\text{-}mangoldt}\\vdash\n\\Lambda(n)\\coloneqq\n\\sum_{\\substack{p\\in\\mathbb N,\\ m\\in\\mathbb N_{>0}\\\\\n\\operatorname{Prime}_{\\mathbb N}(p),\\ p^m=n}}\n\\log p.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}siegel\\text{-}walfisz\\text{-}totient} \\vdash\n\\varphi(q)\\coloneqq|\\{r\\in q\\mid\\gcd(r,q)=1\\}|","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}siegel\\text{-}walfisz\\text{-}chebyshev} \\vdash \\psi(x;q,a)\\coloneqq\\sum_{\\substack{n\\in\\mathbb N_{>0}\\\\n\\leq x\\\\n\\equiv a\\pmod q}}\\Lambda(n)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}siegel\\text{-}walfisz} \\vdash \\mathrm{SiegelWalfisz}_S(A)\\leftrightarrow\\left(A\\in\\mathbb R_{>0}\\land\\exists C_A,c_A,x_A\\in\\mathbb R_{>0}\\;\\forall x\\in\\mathbb R\\;\\left(\\max\\{3,x_A\\}\\leq x\\to\\forall q\\in\\mathbb N_{>0}\\;\\left(q\\leq(\\log x)^A\\to\\forall a\\in\\mathbb Z\\;\\left(\\gcd(a,q)=1\\to\\left|\\psi(x;q,a)-\\frac{x}{\\varphi(q)}\\right|\\leq C_Axe^{-c_A\\sqrt{\\log x}}\\right)\\right)\\right)\\right)","display":true},{"tex":"x","display":false},{"tex":"q","display":false},{"tex":"a","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"p","display":false}],"bytes":2379,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1156","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-siegel-walfisz.md|58-df-siegel-walfisz]]（batch02）"}],"outgoing":["6c68e3aece7c6ffc","244943f88396309f","3322615e4eea05e9"]}